PSEUDOREPLICATION NOTE: this contrast is PER LINE. The 15 HGS lines come from 12
  patients (families 1369, 2295, 3133 each contribute 2), so 3 of the 15 'replicates'
  are additional models from already-represented patients and the Wald/BH statistics are anti-conservative by an
  undisclosed amount. scripts/21_rna_sensitivity.R re-runs the HGS contrast and this
  GO recovery on the 28 patient representatives; report the two together.

